{"seq":1,"slug":"eval-foundations","title":"Eval Foundations","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"personal-golden-sets","title":"个人 Golden 集的构建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/personal-golden-sets","wordCount":1953,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"prompt-skill-versioning","title":"Prompt 与 Skill 的版本化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/prompt-skill-versioning","wordCount":2031,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"regression-before-change","title":"改前回归的纪律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/quality-feedback-loops/eval-foundations/regression-before-change","wordCount":2071,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>个人尺度的评测不需要平台与团队，只需要一套小而有效的纪律：给每个常用的 prompt 与 skill 维护一组带预期的 golden 样例，把它们当代码一样版本化，并在任何行为变更前先跑回归。本章从 golden 集的构建讲起，再讲 prompt 与 skill 的版本管理，最后落到「改前回归」这条最小但最关键的工程纪律。这三件事合在一起，就是一个人也能负担得起的质量反馈闭环。</p>\n"}